                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "heading",
                  "attrs": {
                    "level": 1
                  },
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "Solidarity Suppers be fed with intention."
                    }
                  ]
                },
                {
                  "type": "paragraph",
                  "content": [
                    {
                      "type": "text",
                      "text": "We host small Solidarity Suppers to nourish and council with indigenous relatives, community elders, mothers, and movement leaders. They are invitational spaces where people show up on behalf of their communities, organizations, neighborhoods, and ecologies in the spirit of regenerating our capacities for fellowship and solidarity. We are creating spaces that intentionally lift up the existing leaders of the regenerative movement in our bioregion."
                    }
                  ]
                }
              ]
            }
          },
          "column": 0
        },
        {
          "id": "blk_yrqgravrqe",
          "type": "text",
          "v": 1,
